  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Olikanassa Year 1 CSF 10-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the health, well-being and resilience of people affected by leprosy, disability, gender injustice and climate change in Zambezia province, rural Mozambique.&#xa0; The project will train health workers to improve leprosy care and manage complications, teach communities climate-smart agricultural skills, building cooperatives to enhance food security and resilience. It will also educate women and young girls on climate change and health rights.</narrative>
  </description>
